s of the Persian Empire and they destroyed the [Temple].", "Imagine yourself now: you're a Bedouin Arab, desert Bedouin Arab, who have no knowledge of military tactics; you don't have an Army. The only thing the Arabs knew at the time is language and poetry, and you're talking about the Roman and Persian Empire.", "Now someone might come: OK, this history of the defeat, where do you get it from? It's your Muslim sources. We would say: No! If you open Chronicles of Theophanes, which is from a Greek historian who is recording history, which is a well-accepted academic Source, it's not a Muslim Source. He records the exact dates that I'm giving you about the defeat of Persian Empire and the defeat of the Romans and the Persians. So this is verifiable information from external sources.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Intelligent Man Examines The Evidences For Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CyXdIF4BXok", ((1461, "24:21–24:42"), (1487, "24:47–25:16"), (1546, "25:46–25:57"), (1562, "26:02–26:07"), (1595, "26:35–26:50"), (1614, "26:54–27:01"), (1629, "27:09–27:27"),), id: 1220)
