#passage(("The Meccan Arabs, they sent a bounty hunter. They said: we'll give you 100 camels, like millions now, if you bring us Prophet Muhammad ﷺ. He came close to the Prophet. His horse kept sinking in the sand and he fell. So he realized there was something supernatural about him. So he said: I give you peace. Then Prophet Muhammad ﷺ said to him: would you leave us, and you will hold the bracelets of the Persian King in your hand.", "Now, how many things can go wrong with that prediction? Everything! The Muslims could not take over the Persian..., which is the most biggest hurdle in this story, which is to take over the Persian empire and to take over the bracelets to begin with.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Atheist Challenges Muslim On Evolution! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hBuaweGxlDg", ((792, "13:12–13:44"), (841, "14:01–14:13"),), id: 1235)
