#passage(("The prophetﷺ said: you will overcome the Roman and Persian Empires. And when he was saying that, he had barely got 300 followers around him. When the Prophetﷺ was there, he was being persecuted in Mecca. He didn't know if he's going to live tomorrow or not; his companions didn't know if they're going to live tomorrow or not. And all of a sudden, this man is telling them: you will overcome the biggest empires of the time, the Roman and Persian Empires. An atheist historian, he said this is paramount to saying the Eskimos are going to conquer USA and Russia. Imagine you go to the Eskimos now and say to all this bunch of Eskimos: you're going to conquer... So it was the same thing.", "And now look at the map: Islam spread exactly what the Prophetﷺ said. He said: زُوِيَتْ لِي الأَرْضُ, \"the earth was projected on to me, and I've seen Eastern side and Western side\". And Islam was spread in the East and the West of Saudi Arabia.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clever Atheist Pushes Back Against Muslim! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dToXMJpuY70", ((574, "9:34–10:40"), (640, "10:40–10:47"),), id: 1246)
