#passage(("Prophetﷺ named the countries that Islam will enter, by name: \"Islam is going to enter Egypt; Islam is going to enter Constantinople–Turkey, India, Pakistan, Sham, which is Syria, Lebanon, Jordan, Palestine, Yemen\", by name, all of these countries! He's naming them. He's saying Islam will enter there. He's saying \"they will defeat the Roman and Persian Empire\". They defeated the Roman and Persian Empire! How can he know these things, talking about the two biggest major empires of the time? You have a group of Bedouin Arabs, with no technology, nothing, talking about the two biggest empires of the time. But this is what happened! With names! Every land the Prophetﷺ said that Islam will enter, it entered.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Islam Unveiled: Compelling Evidence For The Truthfulness Of Islam | Chicago - USA | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AUFsBco_CF0", ((2571, "42:51–43:42"),), id: 1247)
// U ML365:301-340 | The Muslim Lantern | 1
#passage(("He said you will overcome the Roman and Persian Empires. And the point is, Prophet Muhammad, when he was saying that, he was in a battle; he was out-numbered, three to one. He was building a Trench, because they were coming to attack him, three to one. The Jews, he had a treaty, they were behind him in the city; they betrayed him. And he didn't know if they were going to kill the people in the city, and the 10,000 people coming to kill them, three to one. And when they were building the Trench, they came across a huge mass of rock. They couldn't crash it. They couldn't destroy it. So they brought the Prophet ﷺ. So he came, and when he was hitting, he hit the first one, he said: I see Persia, I see its palaces, and Islam will enter, he's saying, in that situation, where you don't even know you're going to live tomorrow or not.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Atheist Challenges Muslim On Evolution! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hBuaweGxlDg", ((730, "12:10–12:59"),), id: 1248)
// U ML159:262-282 | The Muslim Lantern | 2
#passage(("The Prophet said the last Persian king in that region will be the last one once you conquer it, and the Roman king in that region will be the last one. And this is what happened historically: in that region, there was no more Roman kings or Rulers; it was the last one in this area after the Muslims conquered.", "The Prophet predicted how the Mongols will come, and their invasion; how their eyes look, their foreheads; they will have hair on their boots. You had Sheikh al Islam Ibn Taymiyyah, and you had many major scholars who were living in that time. They said this was the biggest time for them! The Prophet said this at their time like 800 years before or something, and they're looking with their eyes: exactly what the Prophet described that will happen is happening.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Surprises Truth Seeker With Evidences Of Prophethood! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JOwaMQoXaBQ", ((900, "15:00–15:17"), (924, "15:24–15:50"),), id: 1249)
