#passage(("You have the Prophet Muhammadﷺ in a very well-known prophecy that he said, \"You'll see the barefoot Bedouin Arabs competing in building the tallest buildings.\" Where is the tallest building in the world today? Burj Khalifa in Dubai. Fifty years ago, it was a desert. What happened? They found oil. And oil was not of value until today, because we're using it in technology.", "The Prophetﷺ said that \"the earth will puke it's treasures, like gold and silver\". He said, \"the money will also become abundant within you\": يَكْثُرَ فيكمُ المالُ فيَفيضَ (The money will become abundant within you). So the earth will puke its treasures, the money will become abundant within you, and you will build, and compete in building up all these buildings. And this is exactly what we see happening today. Who is doing it? The barefoot Bedouin Arabs, like the Prophetﷺ said. What they're doing, building tall buildings, like the Prophetﷺ said. The means of it, the Prophetﷺ mentioned it. So you see it with your own eyes. There are prophecies at the time of the Prophetﷺ, after him, and today.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Islam Unveiled: Compelling Evidence For The Truthfulness Of Islam | Chicago - USA | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AUFsBco_CF0", ((2342, "39:02–39:20"), (2368, "39:28–39:59"),), id: 1252)
