#passage(("Samuel says the verse uses the term \"if\", implying no miracle occurred. However, verse 1 and 3 are clearly in the past tense. Samuel quotes 18 examples of verses referring to future events. However, if you actually return to every single one of these verses, you'll realize that every single one of these verses is speaking about the future. Only the splitting of the moon is referred to in past tense.",), "Farid Responds, “Did Prophet Muhammad ﷺ Perform Miracles? [Response Video]”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qC6saY7PZ6Y", ((417, "6:57–7:21"),), id: 1325)
