#passage(("We can say that by looking at anyone making claims, anyone in human history, you should be able to determine whether this person is truthful or not. Because, as the 'ulama (scholars) said, and Sheikh al Islam ibn Taymiyya, among others, mentioned this: the difference between a liar and a Prophet of Allah is like the sun and the moon! You can easily tell a liar from a person of truth.", "That's why you see a lot of these liars that came after the Prophetﷺ claiming Prophethood: the easiest thing to do is to refute them. Like, for example, this guy who came, Joseph Smith, and he made false prophecies of the future. He was racist; even his own followers, they say he was a racist. And then he's saying he's a Messenger, someone sent by God. So it's not hard to tell when someone is a liar and someone is a Messenger of God.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Islam Unveiled: Compelling Evidence For The Truthfulness Of Islam | Chicago - USA | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AUFsBco_CF0", ((482, "8:02–8:44"), (527, "8:47–9:09"),), id: 1343)
