#passage(("We can look from the creation of God, we can know that God is the most good. Let's say this rather than say \"all good\", because some people, they get confused there. Then they say: why is there suffering? No, God is the most good. So, you can see from the creation how God is merciful with the creation. We can see the attributes of mercy of God within us, how we're created, how the universe is created, how the earth is created.", "So, if God is a merciful creator, is a good creator, then that good creator is not going to give the ability to someone who is a liar to have evidence and confuse the people and lie to the people. Because if you say, for example, that God gives the ability to someone to be a true prophet of God while he is a liar, then nobody is accountable for doing bad, because then people are doing bad thinking that this person is a messenger from God. How do I know he's a messenger from God? God has showed me these miracles, that God did, not the prophet, so I can know that he's sent by God. So, a messenger is by definition a representative delivering a message from God.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Agnostic Claims That Pantheism Is More Rational Than Monotheism! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C3BXt0zJr3o", ((992, "16:32–16:51"), (1011, "16:51–17:29"),), id: 1345)
