#passage(("The first and most important thing to consider is that his message is consistent with the previous prophets and messengers. He brought the same message to the people: that there's only one God worthy of worship. When Moses was around, he told the people: \"Oh, Israel, your Lord God is one God.\" Prophet Muhammad taught the same thing, one God. He also taught the people to worship the same God of the previous messengers, the God of Abraham, the God of Jesus, the God of Moses. That's what the Quran teaches. And he affirmed their message. He said these were true messengers coming from God, but the people have changed their teachings later.", "Then the prophet Muhammad, when he came: you study his life, you saw that he was the most honest, the most trustworthy. He didn't go for financial gain and worldly gain; he didn't lie to the people ever. Even the people who were his enemies admitted that he was the most truthful and honest. He lived being persecuted, calling people to worship God alone and to be away from idols. Any false prophet will always go for something: he either wants status, money, worldly gains, women, this and that. But when you look at the life of Prophet Muhammad, you see that everything that people will want, the prophet left for the sake of God.", "He endured persecution and people threatening his life for 13 years in Mecca, until he went to Medina. And they still tried to attack him with war, one after the other. And he still defended himself. And he continued until his death upon calling people to worship God alone. He said to the people: don't overpraise me; I'm the messenger of God and his servant. So we can see that he is in line of all these prophets and messengers.", "But he also brought signs, because prophets bring signs. Prophets prophesy. Prophet Muhammad, for example, named all the countries that are Muslim today. He said that they will become Muslim. Prophet talked about [al-Sham], Levant, which is Syria, Lebanon, Palestine, Jordan; Yemen. He said all of these countries. He said Egypt. He said present day Turkey. He said India and Pakistan.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Lady Grills Muslim With Questions Then A Surprise Happens! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JOpckbnPmsM", ((3009, "50:09–50:47"), (3047, "50:47–51:30"), (3090, "51:30–51:54"), (3114, "51:54–52:27"),), id: 1349)
