#passage(("The Prophet lived with these people for 40 years before he got revelation from God. He was an honest and trustworthy individual within the society, that everyone would accept what he said. Everyone will accept this testimony before he gets revelation. When he got revelation, he went to the top of a mountain, and he told people: \"If I told you there's an army behind this mountain, who's going to attack you, would you believe me?\" They said: \"We have never known you to lie.\" He said: \"I'm the Prophet of God.\" They said: \"We don't accept you!\" So they accept that army, but they will not accept him. Why? Because they used to be pagans; they used to worship idols.", "So, Prophet Muhammad started a mission of preaching. Allah revealed to him a verse: یَـٰۤأَیُّهَا ٱلۡمُدَّثِّرُ ۝ قُمۡ فَأَنذِرۡ (Stand up and deliver the Message) (alMuddaththir74:1-2). So he went and he started delivering the Message. What happened to him? Persecution after persecution after persecution! His Companions, female Companions and male ones, were killed. They were being tortured. They used to put iron on them in the hot sun of 50 degrees of Makkah. Your skin will melt! The Prophet used to pray, and they came; they stepped on his neck while he's prostrating; they were going to suffocate him. One of his Companions pushed the guy away.", "And this remained for 10 years. Allah did not give the Prophet permission to fight. Now, if the Prophet was not a real Prophet, he would have given himself permission to fight: because I've been suffering for 10 years, my Companions are suffering, and I'm not really a Prophet, let me just say God gave me the permission to fight! But Allah said to him: you're not going to fight.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “2 Jews Question The Truth of Islam! Muhammed Ali - Speakers Corner”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kKviK80NYiM", ((695, "11:35–12:25"), (751, "12:31–13:02"), (786, "13:06–13:21"),), id: 1356)
