#passage(("If someone were to say that Prophet Muhammad is God, then he's a disbeliever in Islam. You are out of the religion. A man said to him (he didn't say to him, you're God, he just said to him) \"what Allah wills and you will\", then the Prophet got angry, and then he said to him: did you make me an equal to Allah? You put me in the same sentence with God? Are you trying to make me equal to God? In fact, just standing up for the Prophetﷺ, that was something that Prophet disliked: just when he comes, they just stand up.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Sincere Christian Speaks The Truth About Christianity! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JhnP-6KOjWY", ((759, "12:39–13:36"),), id: 1360)
