#passage(("This is what we call your Fitra (your intuition). Your intuition is already telling you, this person is talking about himself and glorifying himself. It's all about the man. These people have illusions of grandeur. They're lying for their own benefit, so their teachings would reflect their self-desires. So whoever is going to take the leadership is going to descend from that person.", "Prophet Muhammad, for example, when he passed away, he didn't say the next descendant should be someone who comes from my lineage. It was Abu Bakr. He was one of his Companions. Then it was 'Umar, who was another Companion. Then it was 'Uthman, etc. They're all Companions. They're not the children of the Prophet Muhammad or the grandchildren. He didn't say that the only people who can lead after me is my family members. So you see the contrast. You see the difference. You see these things which your intuition starts to tell you that this person was looking for their own benefit.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Baha'i Lady Questions Muslim On The Last Prophet! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5_h1_yrAXLg", ((938, "15:38–17:33"), (1056, "17:36–18:05"),), id: 1361)
