#passage(("There are tens of thousands of Hadith. For example, the Prophetﷺ said: \"None of you will become a Believer until he loves for his brother what he loves for himself.\" The Prophetﷺ said: \"From the Perfection of someone's belief is to leave that which is not his business.\" The Prophetﷺ said: \"Support your brother whether he's oppressor or he's oppressed.\" So they said: \"OK, we support the person if he's oppressed, but if he's the oppressor, how do you support him?\" The Prophet said: \"You stop him from his oppression.\" So, if I see another Muslim oppressing others, I stop that Muslim from oppressing others.", "The Prophetﷺ said: \"If you take care of your daughters they will be a shield for you from Hellfire.\" The Prophetﷺ said that: \"The best of you is who is best to his family members.\" The Prophetﷺ said that: \"There is no difference between an Arab and a non-Arab, a Black and a White; we're all coming from dust. Adam was from dust and we're all from Adam, and the best of us is the one who has the most piety,\" who's closest to God. These were the teachings of Prophet Muhammad. This is what the Quran and Hadith are teaching. This is what Allah is teaching us to do. Allah teaches us in the Quran that you have to be just and upright even against your family members. So, if The Truth is against my family members, I have to say The Truth, even if my family members are the ones who did that wrong thing.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Family Grills Muslim On His Beliefs! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TKqmYTyocyo", ((837, "13:57–14:28"), (880, "14:40–15:24"),), id: 1363)
