#passage(("Prophet Muhammad ﷺ, he came 1400 years ago. The person who claims to be the Messenger of God, he's one of two things: he is either the biggest liar out there, or he is the most truthful person. There's no third option. Because if you lie about God, then you're the biggest liar out there. You're lying about the Creator. And if you're not lying and God chose you, then you're the most honest person, because God chose you. So, don't you think it's an easy thing to differentiate between the most honest person and the biggest liar? It's easy to find out who the biggest liar is.", "When you study the biography of Prophet Muhammad, you will be able to easily find out if he was a liar. There's no doubt about that, because you look at his life and you'll see from his behaviour, this guy mustn't be a liar. And that's why we saw all the false prophets throughout history: they were always found out, they lied so many times and people find out they lied. They died in the worst of places. They made so many claims. They said \"God told me this\", and then in the end it never happens, because these people are liars. So it's not hard at all for someone to find out who's a true Messenger and who's not. All you have to do is to look at his life, to look at what he's doing in his life. Now, if you look at the life of Prophet Muhammad, you will know that there's no doubt that he's a Messenger of God and that he's a truthful individual.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “American Asks Muslim Why He Believes In Prophet Mohammed! - Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=t0qjjh-k2WU", ((0, "0:00–0:49"), (55, "0:55–1:30"),), id: 1365)
