#passage(("How would he know science? Where is he going to learn it? No one at that time knew this information. Learn science from where? There were no universities at the time. There was no Einstein and those people were teaching at universities or something. There was no such thing; he was living in the deserts of Arabia, and most of the things that the Greeks believed were false. If he went to learn from the Greeks, he would learn that the Earth is flat, the human baby is formed like a small baby in the human beings and it grows like this, or a half of it is formed and then the other half is formed. He would learn all of this false information the Greeks used to believe. So where did he learn that science from?", "And he said things we will be doing today. How is that related to learning science or not learning science? He's telling you the actions that we will be doing. He's talking about what will happen to things which are in the economy, in the society, like interest and usury and these things. How would he know any of this?", "If you have any rational sense, if you have any common sense, you cannot reject it. I cannot convince myself Islam is not the Truth, even if I try, even if I have the best argumentative person, even if all of the atheists gather around me and try to give me information; it is not going to affect me, because they're not going to be able to: there is no other rational explanation you can provide to respond to the points that I made. The only rational explanation is that he was a Messenger of God. And that's why all of these other religions, the best they can do is to try to attack: \"The Prophet did this and that!\" They never attack the source of Islam, they never attack the Quran, the information within the Quran, the evidences of Islam that we've put forward, because they cannot refute it. They cannot refute these things; they have to rely on other things to try to pretend that Islam is not the Truth, and live in their delusion thinking that their religion is the truth.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Afghan Girl Claims That Muslims Are Blind Followers?! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7HhWSHopwFc", ((2283, "38:03–38:37"), (2321, "38:41–38:57"), (2381, "39:41–40:26"),), id: 1373)
