#passage(("The Miracles that people mentioned usually about Jesus Performing Miracles: those Companions of prophet Muhammedﷺ have also witnessed Prophet Muhammedﷺ performing Miracles. A lot of Christians don't know this. But this was one of the reasons they believed that he's a Messenger of God so much, and they had no doubt to fight. And how Islam spread? Because they knew this man was a Messenger of God!", "Someone looking for Authority would not be doing the opposite of what Authority is, which is not having a throne, refusing authority when it's offered to him, etc. Even how he treated the people, the Prophetﷺ: one time he was lining people up in the Army, and one of the bellies were going out. So the prophetﷺ used a stick and he pushed it a little bit back. So that person got upset, and he said to the prophetﷺ: Oh Prophet of Allah, I need my revenge, because you did this to me. Now someone who's an authoritarian is going to say: how can you speak to me like this! I'm the messenger of Allah! Don't talk to me like that! But the Prophetﷺ lifted his clothes and he said: take your right back. So that person kissed the Prophetﷺ; he didn't want revenge, he just wanted to kiss the Prophetﷺ. But the point is: this type of events in his life shows what kind of an individual he was. If he was truly looking for any Authority, he would not ever be behaving in the way that he was behaving.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Lady Skeptical About The Prophet of Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QIxWrKc_J_Y", ((1620, "27:00–27:16"), (1662, "27:42–28:41"),), id: 1377)

