#passage(("The interesting thing is this: if you accept him as a Messenger, Prophet Muhammadﷺ, he didn't say he's just for the Arabs; he said he's for everyone and has a universal Message. But he did come first to the Arabs to change all of the problems that the Arabs had. They were worshipping Idols, killing young daughters, and all of these things, and that's what Allah says in the Quran, that he sent him to take people out of darkness into light.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Does Jesus Possess The Attributes of God?! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2Jp6DQffnZg", ((1980, "33:00–33:18"),), id: 1383)
