#passage(("I have had people make all sorts of excuses. Someone was telling me Prophet Muhammad was the smartest human in history. He was the biggest genius. That's why he knew all of this. I told him, \"Okay, he took all this knowledge from here or there,\" which wasn't even there. But in order for him to take knowledge, he had to have traveled the entire planet; spoke Greek, spoke ancient Aramaic, spoke Syriac, spoke ancient Hebrew, read the Hebrew scriptures, read the Greeks and their differences, had the knowledge of knowing what is right and wrong so he can pick the right and leave the wrong; somehow got all the prophecies of the future correct. Somehow he was so smart, he traveled to Egypt where nobody knew and he go inside the pyramid and he started to decipher the hieroglyphics before we found the Rosetta Stone, which we used to translate the language in 1799, and he was 1,400 years ago. Nobody would believe this nonsense. Nobody would believe, because everybody knows it's impossible.", "And if he was doing this because he was the smartest person, he would ask for everything for himself. He would get as much money as he can. He would get as much power as he can. The life of Prophet Muhammad: Prophet would sleep on a mat and he would leave marks on him. And he would wear these cheap clothes.", "Prophet Muhammad one time, he met two of his closest companions; they were coming out. They were walking because they were hungry; there's no food. So they came out of their house, they were hungry. Prophet Muhammad came out, he was hungry. One of them met the other; he said, \"What brought you out?\" Said, \"I was hungry. I didn't find anything.\" Then he met the prophet. Prophet asked, \"What did bring you out?\" Said, \"We're hungry.\" He said, \"I'm hungry, too.\" Then there was one Muslim, and he said, \"Okay, come on. I'm inviting you to come and eat.\"", "So, if he was making all of this stuff up, why would he go and tell people: worship God alone, leave the idol worship, and need to be fought, and they attack him and try to kill him because he told them leave idol worship? He wouldn't care about idol worship. If he knew all of this knowledge, he would just be the leader. So, there is no way that you can come up with an explanation except that he was a messenger of God. As the Quran says, \"I'm only following that which has been revealed to me.\"",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Surprises Intelligent Lady With Undeniable Evidence For Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qzJXd-FotIo", ((2167, "36:07–37:09"), (2232, "37:12–38:02"), (2290, "38:10–38:31"), (2379, "39:39–40:24"),), id: 1384)
