#passage(("What the prophet did, it would be against any utility. Why? Because the prophet told them, \"You Arabs, who used to have unlimited amount of wives, who used to have women completely naked around the [Kaaba] circling, and used to have all of these houses where you just bring the woman and take her there and do whatever you want with her, didn't used to give inheritance to the women: this is what you have to do now. You cannot fornicate. If you do, we will lash you. You cannot commit adultery, or you'll be [penalized] by stoning. You have to preserve yourself and not do anything with women. All these women, everything you're doing: no. Stop here. Don't drink alcohol.\"", "But this alcohol, they used to drink like water. They said, when the verse of prohibition came, the whole streets flooded with so much alcohol these people, the Arabs, used to drink. He came to them with everything against utility, everything against the pleasures of this world. The prophet said it's better for you to be hit with an iron rod than to touch a woman that is not lawful to you.", "Imagine he's saying to these people, who are doing everything they want to do with women, who take any woman they like, \"Stop here. You're not allowed to do that. Only through marriage are you allowed to have a woman, and you have to give her rights, and you have to pay her all this [mahr]. You have to continue providing for her. She doesn't have to pay anything. If she works, her money is her money.\" Let alone: you have to wake up in the morning and pray [fajr]; you have to fast the entire Ramadan; you have to give your wealth and charity.", "Prophet would teach everything against the utility of anyone who's trying to bring people in. Someone who's trying to bring people in, he'll be like Paul. You know what he's going to do? \"Do whatever you want. Jesus took the sins away. Don't worry about food and drink; all of this doesn't make you dirty, whatever. Let's just believe Jesus died for your sins. You're saved. You got a free ticket to the connection with God, the Wi-Fi connection with God. All you got to do is just to believe in it.\" That's what someone who just wants people to believe would do. Islam is not the easy way.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Convert Attempts To Convince A Muslim Of Christianity! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rsp5eGYtL3Y", ((3548, "59:08–59:52"), (3593, "59:53–1:00:14"), (3614, "1:00:14–1:00:47"), (3649, "1:00:49–1:01:21"),), id: 1385)
