#passage(("What I presented as evidences for Islam: for example, Prophet Muhammadﷺ speaking about the future: multiple prophecies that he's made are clear-cut, not just speculations. The fact that the Quran is talking about the Natural World, and how it mentions things that we're learning today that no one knew at the time, and the previous Scriptures do not mention. The fact that the Quran is inimitable in the Arabic Language: no one is able to imitate the Quran, and it's always been the case for Arabs, and no one Academic who learned the Arabic Language, or an Arab, is able ever to produce anything like it. So do you think that Islam is short of evidence to show that it is from God?", "So imagine now Satan sitting on his chair, and he's saying, \"I'm going to inspire this man to move people away from Polytheism into Monotheism and worshipping the One True God! And then I'm going to teach him to say to the people to give women rights after they had no rights, zero rights in Pre-Islamic: no inheritance; they were being used and abused; you can do whatever you want to them; they're property in the streets.\" Even one of the Companions of the Prophet Muhammedﷺ, the second Caliphate of Islam, Umar Ibn Alkhattab, he said that we did not give any care about women until Islam came. In the Pre-Islamic times they were nothing; when they had news of a daughter they used to get upset; they used to bury their own daughters alive, because it was war and you need men as a tribe, a strong tribe; you don't need a woman.", "So why would Satan call people to be good to your parents (Quran4:36), and teach you in the Quran that Satan is your biggest enemy, as the Quran says (Quran17:53) and (2:36) and (2:202) and so many other verses, and that you should seek refuge from Satan (Quran7:200), and you should do that which is good (Quran18:110)? Why would it make any sense for you to say that he's deceived by Satan, and then Satan is commanding him to do everything that goes against Satan? So if you believe Christianity is true, then that point is impossible, because it wouldn't make sense that Christianity is true and then Prophet Muhammad says to people: believe in Jesus! Why would he say to them to believe in Jesus? The only other religion other than Christianity that believes in Jesus is Islam.", "It's impossible that Prophet Muhammadﷺ was not a Messenger Of God. If they say he wasn't saying the Truth, they cannot bring any other rational explanation to what he did: the miracles that he did, life, the commands that he did, the way he lived his life. It's impossible for you to say that he wasn't a Messenger Of God, especially if you're A Christian, because if you're A Christian, you believe in father who did incest his own daughter is A Prophet! You believe David, who killed the man... If you believe these things, the last thing is you will have any concern about Prophet Muhammadﷺ! The only one who speaks from Satan is the one who was doing the acts that I mentioned before; this is the person that you can say is inspired by Satan!",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Lady Enquires About Heaven In Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NyrpGRsef5I", ((1631, "27:11–27:48"), (1724, "28:44–29:28"), (1772, "29:32–30:28"), (1866, "31:06–31:34"),), id: 1390)
