#passage(("You get some Christians, also with no brain cells, would say that this is a Message from Satan: Satan came in the mountain and all of that. Do you think that the angel Gabriel came to the Prophetﷺ one time? Angel Gabriel came numerous times to the Prophetﷺ. Some of them, the Companions were present, like in the Hadith of Abu Hurayra and 'Umar, etc., where Gabriel came, and he asked: what is Islam (Submission)? What is Iman (Faith)? What is Ihsan (Excelling in worship)?", "The angel Gabriel came in the form of a human, and people saw him and said, who is this? He was wearing white, and there is no signs of travelling. So, I'm walking in the desert; you know how the desert is, and the dust and the storm. I'm travelling and I'm not from the city; everyone knows who is in the city; and there is no signs of travelling on me. They saw this, and then that's why they asked the Prophetﷺ, who is this? And then he said, هذا جبريل (this is Gabriel): \"This is Jibreel, came to teach you your religion.\"", "So they say this is from Satan. We say to them: OK, which Satan comes and says, \"Stop idol worshipping\"? (anNajm53:19-23) \"Stop committing fornication\"! (al Isra'17:35) \"Worship God alone\"! (alAn'am6:19) \"Be good to your neighbour\"! (anNisa4:36) \"Give charity\"! (alBaqara2:43) \"Believe in Jesus\"! (anNisa4:171) \"Believe in Moses\" (alBaqara2:92) \"Believe in Abraham\" (alBaqara2:132) \"Believe in the Prophets and Messengers of God\" (alBaqara2:136) \"Worship God alone\" (al Isra17:23) \"Do not associate any partners with him\" (alAn'am6:151) \"Destroy all of these idols that you see around you\" (in Prophetic Tradition)", "\"Satan is your biggest enemy\" (Fatir35:6) \"Satan is the reason- he did not prostrate..\" (Ssad38:71-76) \"And he got the لعنة and curse of Allahﷻ\" (Ssad38:77-78) \"He's عدو مُبين (sworn enemy), he has steps; do not follow his footsteps\" (alBaqara2:208) \"Whenever you recite the Scripture, seek refuge from Satan\" (anNahl16:98). Which Satan is doing this? Come tell, explain to us: which Satan is going teaching everyone to avoid everything that Satan teaches? (anNur24:21)", "How ridiculous this claim is, is عجيب (bizarre), subhanAllah! How these people still come with a claim like this and think that they're doing something. And even Jesus, in their Scripture (in which they would attribute to him to be authentic), he was accused by the Pharisees and the Jews at the time; they told him that you are from Satan (Mat.12:22-28). He said the same thing in their own Scripture. But they would still come and say, \"Oh, Prophet Muhammadﷺ was from Satan\", anything, so they reject his Messengerhood, his Prophethood.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Islam Unveiled: Compelling Evidence For The Truthfulness Of Islam | Chicago - USA | Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AUFsBco_CF0", ((931, "15:31–15:53"), (957, "15:57–16:24"), (988, "16:28–16:48"), (1011, "16:51–17:10"), (1035, "17:15–17:48"),), id: 1391)
