#passage(("The Quran is not based on one man's claim. There is instances with angel Gabriel came, and all the Companions saw him, and he taught the people the religion: that what is Islam? And then he gave them the 5 pillars. And what is Iman? (Faith) So many people have seen the Revelation. That's number one. Number two, many people have seen the miracles! We have mass reported narrations of miracles that Prophet Muhammadﷺ did, and his people saw. So no, it's not based on one claim of one man.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Atheist Disproves The Quran?! Is Ezra The Son Of God? Islam Predates Judaism|”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0_RrmYKq0qU", ((1334, "22:14–23:19"),), id: 1395)
