 worshipers rejected him, was Prophet Muhammad! So, which Prophet would you think the Bible is talking about? Going to the Arabs, going to Saudi Arabia, Medina, preaching to people who will be worshipping idols? Isaiah, chapter 42, the whole chapter. Also, you can find them in many other places.", "Deuteronomy18:18, it says there will be a Prophet who will come, and he will be from the brethren of the Jews. The Ishmaelites, the Arabs, are the brethren of the Jews, because Ishmael was the brother of Isaac, who's the son of Abraham. So, it says a Prophet will come like Moses. Moses was a man who fought in wars. Moses migrated; he left from Egypt to the Land of Palestine. Moses had wives, he had children. Jesus did not fight wars, so he's not a Prophet like Moses. Jesus does not have children, did not get married, did not migrate. The only Prophet that did the same thing like Moses was Prophet Muhammad. Which Prophet that came that is like Moses, other than Prophet Muhammad? There is none!", "But I believe just looking at the life of Prophet Muhammad is enough evidence. The only other religion that gives respect to Jesus other than Christianity is Islam. Other religions reject Jesus. Only Islam accepts Jesus, accepts all the Messengers of God.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Curious Lady Grills Muslim! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2A4ifgnoA5Q", ((249, "4:09–4:35"), (277, "4:37–4:58"), (321, "5:21–5:54"), (359, "5:59–6:37"), (401, "6:41–7:42"), (467, "7:47–7:56"),), id: 1419)
