 are corrupted beliefs that the Christians and the Jews are having at the time in the Deserts of Arabia.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Clip-React| Responding To Professor Jiang's Lecture On The Islamic Golden Age | Muhammed Ali!”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6SVGKQ-xiGs", ((3596, "59:56–1:00:37"), (3640, "1:00:40–1:01:04"), (3681, "1:01:21–1:01:53"),), id: 1460)
