#passage(("Me saying that about him doesn't mean I'm gonna treat him like an evil person or have a fight with him. But I have to be honest with him. I cannot lie to him and compromise and change my faith and beliefs just to please him and make him feel good about himself, which some people do in the West: show you a face, and they lie to you, give you a different face; they don't tell you their true beliefs. The reason I'm saying that to you is because you believe there's an extra Messenger.", "In the Quran, Jesus, عيسى عليه السلام, he said a Prophet will come after him called Ahmad, and he's referring to Prophet Muhammad, saying there will come a Prophet after me (Quran61:6). The Ahmadis say this is referring to Mirza Ghulam Ahmad. So they say that Jesus is predicting Mirza Ghulam Ahmad, and they say Mirza Ghulam Ahmad is a reincarnation of Jesus, or the remanifestation of Jesus and Prophet Muhammad. So how is he saying \"I will come after me\"?",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Muslim Questioned On Sectarianism In Islam! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MnwLenfsZWA", ((861, "14:21–14:40"), (887, "14:47–15:11"),), id: 1488)
