#refbox("Reference text: Quran 61:6, quran.com (Saheeh International)", (("61:6", "And [mention] when Jesus, the son of Mary, said, \"O Children of Israel, indeed I am the messenger of Allāh to you confirming what came before me of the Torah and bringing good tidings of a messenger to come after me, whose name is Aḥmad.\" But when he came to them with clear evidences, they said, \"This is obvious magic.\""),))
