#passage(("Please do go through some of these points again, take notes, share with your teachers, with your [sheikhs], try to get answers from them, and I guarantee you will receive one of two things: silence or really bad answers. Now, how do you know that these are bad answers? Well, after receiving them, compare the answers that you got to the points that are made, and if you're not satisfied by the answers, or you thought that they had nothing to do with the points being made, or that they do not [refute] the points that are being made, then those are bad answers. The good news from this is that you now can come to the Orthodox Islam: Islam without intermediaries and Islam without false prophets. Muhammad, peace be upon Him, is the final Prophet, after all.",), "Farid Responds, “Failed Prophecies of Mirza Ghulam Ahmad”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Gb9bWdWNblY", ((1134, "18:54–19:49"),), id: 1496)

=== 23.7 Claims to be the Mahdi and the motives of claimants
// NODE P04.C06.S07
#author("The Muslim Lantern")
// U ML163:188-236 | The Muslim Lantern | 4
#passage(("There is a variety of reasons why human beings lie. Some psychologists would say there's seven reasons for why human beings essentially lie. These reasons can be wanting some sort of a benefit, like money, fame, or whatever. It can be fear. There are some reasons that you'll see psychologists put for why someone would lie.", "The Prophet said there would be 30 liars after him. He didn't say 30 genuine people who think they're Prophets. No, they are liars! So they know that they're not truly a Messenger. Why would they know? Because there is no Revelation coming to them. They know that they are not Messengers of God, but they are claiming to be Messengers of God. Why? Some people have delusions of grandeur. They think they're the main character; they want to be the main character in life. So: \"Look! I'm the Messenger. Obey me and listen to me, and I'll guide you.\" But if you look at the lives of these people, you always see that there is no objective evidence that is offered that shows that these people are Messengers of God. And you'll see, if they make prophecies, that their prophecies are wrong. They fail in their prophecies, and it's proof that these people are lying.", "So The Truth is, none of these people are actually genuine about being Prophets and Messengers of God. And the basic simple reason is: if they truly did accept Prophet Muhammad, they would have obeyed him. If Prophet Muhammad is the last one, they will never make that claim. But these people, they just want to be important among their people. They want the fame. They want the money. They want the riches. They want to be a status. They want all of these things. And the best, the easiest way to do it is to delude the people. People already believe in Prophets and Messengers: \"OK, I'm another Prophet and Messenger!\" But this is the thing: anyone who comes and says \"I'm a Prophet and Messenger\", there has to be proof that he produces, whether he's a Prophet and Messenger from God. We don't need to accept what he says.", "Let's completely ignore everything I said. I'm going to come to you like someone who's not even a Muslim, and then I'll ask you the question, or anyone from the Bahai faith: produce and give me objective evidence that whom you call a Prophet was a true Prophet from God.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Baha'i Lady Questions Muslim On The Last Prophet! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5_h1_yrAXLg", ((585, "9:45–10:00"), (604, "10:04–10:48"), (651, "10:51–11:33"), (697, "11:37–11:47"),), id: 1497)
// U ML272:205-238 | The Muslim Lantern | 1
#passage(("Imam Almahdi, which is an Arab according to the Prophetﷺ, which is going to come and unite the Muslims, is a guy called Christopher wearing an Egyptian costume, who cannot speak the Arabic language nor understand the Arabic language nor explain the Arabic language? Our Tradition says Imam Almahdi is someone who is a righteous individual that Allahﷻ is going to send, that is going to lead the Muslims or unite them back under one Banner in unity. And he's one of the Major Signs of the Day of Judgement.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Western Man Claims To Be Imam Al Mahdi?! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BUXTxshaUAY", ((589, "9:49–10:40"),), id: 1498)

